<svg width="1400" height="800" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><foreignObject width="1400" height="800"><div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="width:1400px;height:800px;background:#06090d;color:#cfe7ff;font-family:monospace;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:40px"><h1 style="color:#00ff9d;font-size:48px;letter-spacing:0.2em;margin:0">IFR PILOT</h1><p style="font-size:20px;margin:20px 0">Browser-Based Flight Simulator</p><p style="font-size:16px;color:#5b7a99;text-align:center;max-width:800px">Live cockpit instruments including Attitude Indicator, VOR/HSI navigation, and moving map display. Control heading, altitude, and airspeed with keyboard shortcuts.</p></div></foreignObject></svg>